<p>This page is for commercial fridge repair in London hospitality: stainless catering cabinets, prep fridges and back-bar units. We do not repair Bosch, Beko or other household white goods in flats. Coverage includes Islington, Camden, City of London, Newham and Greater London. Tell us the make, model, serial plate, postcode and whether the site is open, in service or closed. Same-day attendance depends on location and workload and is confirmed when you call. ColdDirect does not repair domestic household fridges or freezers.</p>
<p>When you book Fridge Repair London, describe whether the fault started after a delivery, during a hot kitchen service or after a power cut. Those details help the visit. Keep using your own temperature checks and stock procedures until the engineer has finished. All jobs come with warranty on the agreed work. We are commercial specialists only.</p>
